# Release co-ownership
# @DataDog/libdatadog-release is added as an additional co-owner of every
# file the automated crate-release PR touches: each crate's Cargo.toml and CHANGELOG.md,
# plus the workspace Cargo.toml and Cargo.lock. Existing owners are preserved
# These lines are last in the file so they win (last match wins) for these specific files.
# libdatadog-release is registered in DataDog/ci-checks reviewer_teams.yml, so it is not counted as a code
